▶ 5. Consulta direta a cada shard: cada conta só existe no nó da sua região
  pg-europa:
  $ psql "host=pg-europa.global.local,pg-america.global.local port=5432,5433 target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('8263f7fb-02fb-4454-a122-aaf6014cbf89','d193ea85-636f-487f-b5bc-623f63ac7e99')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-EU-00000108 | EUR      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  pg-america:
  $ psql "host=pg-america.global.local,pg-africa.global.local port=5432,5433 target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('8263f7fb-02fb-4454-a122-aaf6014cbf89','d193ea85-636f-487f-b5bc-623f63ac7e99')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-AM-00000106 | USD      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  ✔ GS-EU-00000108 só no pg-europa, GS-AM-00000106 só no pg-america
  a cópia da Europa, guardada no nó pg-america (porta 5433), também a tem (replicação síncrona):
  $ psql "host=pg-america.global.local port=5433 dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, pg_is_in_recovery() AS copia FROM accounts WHERE iban = 'GS-EU-00000108'"
          iban      | copia 
    ----------------+-------
     GS-EU-00000108 | t
    (1 row)
    

